  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life-saving and flexible humanitarian assistance in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main action of the project is to save lives and alleviate suffering of conflict affected people, particularly women and girls in the targeted areas. Improving access to safe Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) services, improving food and livelihood security, strengthening community based protection and empowering women are the major components of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
